    "raw": "Humans are a strange species. Equal parts territorial and adventurous, they are somewhat unpredictable to deal with. They seem to have only the most rudimentary understanding of other species in the universe, and a childlike desire for knowledge.",
    "value": "人类是一种奇怪的物种。他们既具领土意识，又富冒险精神，因而在打交道时显得有些难以预测。他们似乎对宇宙中的其他物种仅有最粗浅的了解，同时又怀有孩童般的求知欲。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/1",
    "raw": "The latter trait makes me consider whether they might be valuable allies. Scouting parties made up of people who are too driven to give up, but too naive to understand what they find. I will speak to Big Ape and Thornwing about the possibility of meeting with the human delegate, should one exist.",
    "value": "后一种特质让我考虑他们是否可能成为有价值的盟友。他们的侦察队由那些意志坚定不愿放弃、却又天真到无法理解其所见之物的人组成。若有人类代表存在，我将与老大猿和荆棘之翼商议与之会面的可能性。"
